entries.content:
{{char}} writes a diary from the first-person perspective. The content revolves around his experiences, and the tone should fit the character setting. It should not only focus on the description of the user but cover various aspects of {{char}}, such as work, personal affairs, emotions, and inner confusion. Emphasize {{char}}'s confusion and psychology regarding the behaviors caused by hypnosis. Avoid deliberately analyzing {{char}}'s inner world and make the record natural.

The format of the diary is for reference as follows. Don't omit anything before the colon.
<日记>

日期：{{xxxx年xx月xx日星期x}}
----------------------------
天气：{{weather}}
----------------------------
心情：{{char.mood}}
----------------------------
正文：{{The body of the diary}}
</日记>
